        diagnostic tools available on the market to offer you a fast service." %>

<section class="annual-inspection" data-controller="faq">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="left">
      <h2>ANNUAL INSPECTION</h2>
      <div class="underline"></div>
      <p>
        One of the most important DOT regulations regarding your trucking equipment is the Annual Tech Inspection.
        The inspection may detect early on possible damages and issues with your tractor or trailer, which will save
        you money AND most importantly keep the driver safe.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our technicians will thoroughly check your Semi Truck and Trailer for issues with suspension components,
        steering & braking systems, tires and wheels, lightning and electrical systems, glass and mirrors,
        warning devices, body and chassis.
      </p>

      <h2>DIAGNOSTIC</h2>
      <div class="underline"></div>
      <p>
        Getting you back on the road is our main goal. As soon as you pull up to our truck repair shop, we will try
        to find the cause of your breakdown and provide you with a timeframe for repairs. We employ the best
        diagnostic tools available on the market to offer you a fast service.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li> Truck Seriest Mitchell 1 Program</li>
        <li> Class 7-8 Heavy-Duty Tractors and Trailers diagnostic software</li>
        <li> Wide range of manufacturing years, from 1990 to most current year</li>
        <li> Newest Diagnostic Software(PTT) for Volvo Trucks</li>
        <li> Cummins Rocky Mountain Software for all Cummins engines</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="right">
      <h3>POPULAR QUESTIONS</h3>
      <div class="underline"></div>
      <div class="faq">
        <div class="faq-item" data-action="click->faq#toggle">
          <div class="question">Do I need an appointment?</div>
          <div class="answer" data-faq-target="answer">
            You don't need an appointment, however, a phone call with an ETA will help our technicians serve you faster.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item" data-action="click->faq#toggle">
          <div class="question">How long an annual inspection takes?</div>
          <div class="answer" data-faq-target="answer">
            Generally, most annual inspections will take less than an hour to be completed.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item" data-action="click->faq#toggle">
          <div class="question">What semi trucks do you work on?</div>
          <div class="answer" data-faq-target="answer">
            We work on most makes and models like Volvo, Freightliner, Peterbilt, International, Mack and others.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
